      "statement": "src/validator.mjs exposes validateData (resolves type, runs validateDataConstraints, and for type: primitive also runs the authoring validator), validateDocument (parses a fenced document then delegates), and createValidator (binds a registry set and returns reusable validateData/validateDocument/resolve).",
