      "statement": "src/primitive.mjs is the primitive-authoring API: definePrimitive normalizes and generates stable symbolic IDs, validatePrimitiveDefinition validates rich definitions, primitiveDefinitionToRegistryEntry compiles a definition into the executable registry shape (required/optional fields, enums, patterns, references, append_only from mutation), and definitionsToExtensionRegistry packages definitions into an extension registry object.",
