      "statement": "Two canonical Draft 2020-12 JSON Schemas govern the shapes: schemas/core-registry.schema.json for core and extension registries (with a primitiveDefinition $def mirroring the runtime-validated fields and additionalProperties false) and schemas/bundle.schema.json for .ucw bundles (export_profile enum, primitive_inventory counts, provisioning step/parameter enums).",
