      "statement": "composeRegistryLayers composes named ownership layers (installed/repository/workspace/user) as a flat composition with source labels and enforces policy floors: a primitive's declared capabilities must be a superset of each floor's required capabilities, so a layer cannot weaken a policy floor.",
